    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello USER, we invite you to participate in a perfectly normal and safe survey!\u00a0Completing the survey will enrol you to have a chance to win a cash prize. The questions are simple, answer as honestly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump right into a interactable environment that rewards you for exploration and experimentation. Mess around with a simulated computer interface, or get up and walk around the room. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable computer and applications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and easily digestible gameplay length</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie styled horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots and lots of mysteries!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots more to discover!</p></li></ul>",
